                                "sense_id": "85e3cb66-0feb-3ba6-b9cc-f51d61ab0066",
                                "text": "Het feest begon om 20:00 uur en eindigde om middernacht.",
                                "translation": "The party started at 8:00 pm and ended at midnight.",
                                "english": "The party started at 8:00 pm and ended at midnight."
                            },
                            {
