                                "sense_id": "85e3cb66-0feb-3ba6-b9cc-f51d61ab0066",
                                "text": "Ze wachtte tot middernacht om hem te verrassen met zijn verjaardagscadeau.",
                                "translation": "She waited until midnight to surprise him with his birthday gift.",
