                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "603d389a-36fa-364e-b82b-fc2bcedf2e9d",
                                        "entry_id": "6441ede0-b90a-3eb0-9120-f32fb6e504fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Utterly dark or black."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57f31eef-4a7b-4b7d-872b-2d333461607c",
                                                "sense_id": "603d389a-36fa-364e-b82b-fc2bcedf2e9d",
                                                "text": "Free and falling, his midnight hair flowed out all around us like a silk canopy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "midnight",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d796100a-211a-3186-80ab-6ba179f2ab1d",
                                        "entry_id": "8c109b6b-b05e-3b56-9d86-8608148ecdd9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The middle of the night: the sixth temporal hour, equidistant between sunset and sunrise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecb2844f-1c7f-4ed2-977b-4d9982f5a061",
                                                "sense_id": "d796100a-211a-3186-80ab-6ba179f2ab1d",
                                                "text": "Thanks to its sonar, the narwhal can remain active even at midnight, unhindered by the darkness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "528e1a23-b5ac-498c-aca6-d6cc53714163",
                                                "sense_id": "d796100a-211a-3186-80ab-6ba179f2ab1d",
                                                "text": "And vpon the first day of the weeke, when the disciples came together to breake bread, Paul preached vnto them, ready to depart on the morrow, and continued his speach vntill midnight."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10c11585-3ec8-3fab-b47e-a3c0686b0638",
                                        "entry_id": "8c109b6b-b05e-3b56-9d86-8608148ecdd9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Twelve o'clock at night exactly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "166166b5-6c23-4a07-901d-03ac659bab57",
                                                "sense_id": "10c11585-3ec8-3fab-b47e-a3c0686b0638",
                                                "text": "She twisted her hands behind her; but all the knots held good! / She writhed her hands till her fingers were wet with sweat or blood! / They stretched and strained in the darkness, and the hours crawled by like years, / Till, now, on the stroke of midnight, / Cold, on the stroke of midnight, / The tip of one finger touched it! The trigger at least was hers!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57399d25-97b8-45ca-90d9-a1ffac604b35",
                                                "sense_id": "10c11585-3ec8-3fab-b47e-a3c0686b0638",
                                                "text": "The police report said that officers, who told CNN they are not currently pursuing criminal charges, arrived to the scene just after midnight and found Gillum and a second person, Aldo Mejias, in the hotel room."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d26f3e43-5150-369e-bec2-933a08c9e969",
                                        "entry_id": "8c109b6b-b05e-3b56-9d86-8608148ecdd9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of boxcars (“a pair of sixes”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a97b36a7-1797-4de5-93b0-ac4b0b6aa72f",
                        "source_entry_id": "32092f6a-fe9d-3b34-8570-c577439a635a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5af78e34-64ac-3f86-b633-f397628e3bde",
                        "source_sense_description": "het midden van de nacht, twaalf tot één uur 's nachts",
                        "target_lang_word": "minuit",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "minuit",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                        "entry_id": "bcde16eb-ba58-3afa-8b6e-73cafa8d9c0e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Heure située au milieu de la nuit, à la limite de deux jours."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91421361-27cb-4d4d-8871-be87a81d0fb6",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "[…] ; les places et les rues attenantes, habituellement si solitaires dès que neuf heures sonnaient à Saint-Germain-l’Auxerrois, étaient, quoiqu’il fût minuit, encombrées de populaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54e85260-569a-4c2e-b6dc-6de74ef072af",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "[…], rien ne resplendit plus, après minuit, que cinq ou six débits mal fréquentés dont l'éclairage ourle le trottoir d'un morne flamboiement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f469939-1e42-4255-a0cf-3b9ffd05a4b5",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "Vers lès minuit, le boulanger vint frapper chez Mme Massot. — (Jean Giono, Jean le Bleu, Grasset, Paris 1932)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7439fab-5d81-4a4c-b03e-d9025480753f",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "Hé Rosaire, quelle heure qu'y est?\n Minuit dans vingt\n Merci ben\n Ça doit être noir de monde su'l'perron d'l'église"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30ea1d28-d47d-46ef-8714-1f07fa01c6ea",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "Sur les minuit, mon oncle est arrivé. nous lui avons demandé pourquoi nos parents n'étaient pas avec lui, il répondit qu'ils étaient allés chez Beaufort, à Arconsat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98bcc04d-6389-439b-87ec-84268504e3f7",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "Et suivant son idée, vers les minuit, il me conduisit à la sortie de l’Éden, où figuraient alors dans un ballet des centaines d’enfants écaillés d’or, se balançant autour d’une danseuse lascive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ed7db91-ec97-4dd8-899a-e076a30a970d",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "C'est trop de minuits sans nouvelles de toi. Le premier nous a anéantis ; les autres n'ont servi à rien ; ils étaient superflus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "817cc5db-0b9a-419c-aa71-b08e8a60a715",
                                                "sense_id": "0caa937e-3e5f-37a3-905e-4eed8f992718",
                                                "text": "C’était un lieu maléfique, où il suffisait de passer sur la minuit pour voir le diable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e9305aa-d8de-4e1d-a4f6-e2dd7077a195",
                        "source_entry_id": "32092f6a-fe9d-3b34-8570-c577439a635a",
